(6312037, 934867, 96751, '<td valign="top">Very nice, and the specks of snow are wonderful.  It reminds me of a studio shot with a similar pose seen last year.  But this is a bit dark for me.  Too much of the bottom half of her body is implied, although it IS a ROT image.</td>', 'Very nice, and the specks of snow are wonderful.  It reminds me of a studio shot with a similar pose seen last year.  But this is a bit dark for me.  Too much of the bottom half of her body is implied, although it IS a ROT image.', '2011-02-14 01:48:37.000000', NULL, 1),
