(6312047, 935466, 96751, '<td valign="top">A VERY red sink.  I wish there were more things that stood out, like the gleam of the metal.  Nicely seen though.</td>', 'A VERY red sink.  I wish there were more things that stood out, like the gleam of the metal.  Nicely seen though.', '2011-02-14 01:51:03.000000', NULL, 1),
