(6312124, 935573, 96751, '<td valign="top">I love the personification you achieved with this.  I''m glad you chose this one.  It''s very clever, well lit, perfectly composed.</td>', 'I love the personification you achieved with this.  I''m glad you chose this one.  It''s very clever, well lit, perfectly composed.', '2011-02-14 02:18:21.000000', NULL, 1),
