(6312127, 935417, 96751, '<td valign="top">I love how it seems that the shell has been there so long, it''s rusting into the snow.   Love the vignette on this, although that is one of those love/hate things around DPC :-)</td>', 'I love how it seems that the shell has been there so long, it''s rusting into the snow.   Love the vignette on this, although that is one of those love/hate things around DPC :-)', '2011-02-14 02:19:59.000000', NULL, 1),
