(6312131, 935523, 96751, '<td valign="top">I''d kill for eyelashes like that.  I also want to put my face against that muzzle.</td>', 'I''d kill for eyelashes like that.  I also want to put my face against that muzzle.', '2011-02-14 02:21:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(6312133, 934605, 96751, '<td valign="top">Nicely done, Sir!  Love the flare and how the ball is suspended just opposite it.  And of course, the long shadows standing around wondering why they''re not moving.</td>', 'Nicely done, Sir!  Love the flare and how the ball is suspended just opposite it.  And of course, the long shadows standing around wondering why they''re not moving.', '2011-02-14 02:21:54.000000', NULL, 1),
