(6312135, 935409, 96751, '<td valign="top">Surrealism at its best.  I LOVE this image.  It is incredibly evocative and puzzling, inspiring and haunting.  But I''m not sure it''s ROT.</td>', 'Surrealism at its best.  I LOVE this image.  It is incredibly evocative and puzzling, inspiring and haunting.  But I''m not sure it''s ROT.', '2011-02-14 02:22:53.000000', NULL, 1),
