(6312952, 935243, 127608, '<td valign="top">Love the story here and the tone you have set with this image. I think the grainy effect adds to the mood... <br/> <br/>8</td>', 'Love the story here and the tone you have set with this image. I think the grainy effect adds to the mood...  8', '2011-02-14 10:55:50.000000', NULL, 1),
