(6312959, 934928, 54446, '<td valign="top">Excellent composition.  You nailed the focus on the zebras.  Monochrome really works here and throws attention to the stripes.  The blurred background is both distracting and a very good technique.  I really like placing wildlife in landscape scenes, but it''s very difficult.  (Ansel Adams never did it.)  I admire your image very much.  9</td>', 'Excellent composition.  You nailed the focus on the zebras.  Monochrome really works here and throws attention to the stripes.  The blurred background is both distracting and a very good technique.  I really like placing wildlife in landscape scenes, but it''s very difficult.  (Ansel Adams never did it.)  I admire your image very much.  9', '2011-02-14 11:02:11.000000', NULL, 1),
(6312961, 935515, 54446, '<td valign="top">I think this is one of the better images in this challenge.  Real life and superb comp.  I admire the panning technique.  Well done!  9</td>', 'I think this is one of the better images in this challenge.  Real life and superb comp.  I admire the panning technique.  Well done!  9', '2011-02-14 11:03:52.000000', NULL, 1),
