(6313059, 935448, 17507, '<td valign="top">I like the framing and the composition, but I would wish for a bit more sharpness on the coon''s face and eye.</td>', 'I like the framing and the composition, but I would wish for a bit more sharpness on the coon''s face and eye.', '2011-02-14 12:27:41.000000', NULL, 1),
