(6314215, 935479, 96751, '<td valign="top">There is much that works about this image: it satisfies the ROT; it is nicely balanced in terms of color, the lighting is strong, and is a well-taken image of an interesting artifact.  But for me, it does not go beyond that.  It is a nice picture from your summer vacation.  There is no story or emotional component to draw me in.  So while technically it is a solid image, it is lacking the "wow" or "pop" factor which would make it an above-average entry.</td>', 'There is much that works about this image: it satisfies the ROT; it is nicely balanced in terms of color, the lighting is strong, and is a well-taken image of an interesting artifact.  But for me, it does not go beyond that.  It is a nice picture from your summer vacation.  There is no story or emotional component to draw me in.  So while technically it is a solid image, it is lacking the "wow" or "pop" factor which would make it an above-average entry.', '2011-02-15 01:42:18.000000', NULL, 1),
