(6315913, 935528, 114225, '<td valign="top">Interesting processing you used in this shot. somehow it feels just a bit like a painting, but not over-done. It''s too bad that yellow tape cuts through the middle, that is really catching my eye and throwing things off.</td>', 'Interesting processing you used in this shot. somehow it feels just a bit like a painting, but not over-done. It''s too bad that yellow tape cuts through the middle, that is really catching my eye and throwing things off.', '2011-02-15 22:41:10.000000', NULL, 1),
(6315918, 935446, 114225, '<td valign="top">What a fun, quirky photo. I hope to see how you processed this. I like how it has just a lightly surreal effect (which compliments the quirkiness well).</td>', 'What a fun, quirky photo. I hope to see how you processed this. I like how it has just a lightly surreal effect (which compliments the quirkiness well).', '2011-02-15 22:42:13.000000', NULL, 1),
(6315920, 935651, 114225, '<td valign="top">Nice job really drawing our eyes into a specific area.</td>', 'Nice job really drawing our eyes into a specific area.', '2011-02-15 22:42:46.000000', NULL, 1),
(6315924, 935611, 114225, '<td valign="top">I like how the viewer''s eye goes directly to the hummingbird, and then moves through the rest of the scene to find the other elements. I do feel like this photo is lacking in contrast. There are no deep darks to offset those bright whites.</td>', 'I like how the viewer''s eye goes directly to the hummingbird, and then moves through the rest of the scene to find the other elements. I do feel like this photo is lacking in contrast. There are no deep darks to offset those bright whites.', '2011-02-15 22:44:02.000000', NULL, 1),
(6315936, 935199, 114225, '<td valign="top">Interesting colors in this scene. The parts of red all over almost feels as if they are washing off the bridge and onto the foliage.</td>', 'Interesting colors in this scene. The parts of red all over almost feels as if they are washing off the bridge and onto the foliage.', '2011-02-15 22:49:37.000000', NULL, 1),
(6315939, 935332, 114225, '<td valign="top">I like where you were headed with this. But somehow I think the processing of this photo has had a strange effect. Looking at the water, there are splotches of what seems like unsaturated bits and pieces. Maybe I''m wrong, but that''s how I''m interpreting what I''m seeing.</td>', 'I like where you were headed with this. But somehow I think the processing of this photo has had a strange effect. Looking at the water, there are splotches of what seems like unsaturated bits and pieces. Maybe I''m wrong, but that''s how I''m interpreting what I''m seeing.', '2011-02-15 22:51:17.000000', NULL, 1),
(6315941, 935333, 114225, '<td valign="top">Beautiful scene. Great job with pulling in some details from the shadow areas while not having blown out highlights. What really makes this scene fore me is the mixture of lilly pads with the reflections of the clouds.</td>', 'Beautiful scene. Great job with pulling in some details from the shadow areas while not having blown out highlights. What really makes this scene fore me is the mixture of lilly pads with the reflections of the clouds.', '2011-02-15 22:52:22.000000', NULL, 1),
(6315942, 935108, 114225, '<td valign="top">Good use of a main subject that slowly drags the viewer''s eyes through the scene, so they can eventually find the birds in the water.</td>', 'Good use of a main subject that slowly drags the viewer''s eyes through the scene, so they can eventually find the birds in the water.', '2011-02-15 22:53:07.000000', NULL, 1),
(6315944, 935669, 114225, '<td valign="top">Great job separating your subject from the background in now only focus but also colors. The slight texture to the background keeps it from being boring.</td>', 'Great job separating your subject from the background in now only focus but also colors. The slight texture to the background keeps it from being boring.', '2011-02-15 22:54:20.000000', NULL, 1),
(6315947, 935638, 121082, '<td valign="top">Very creative idea. I like it.</td>', 'Very creative idea. I like it.', '2011-02-15 22:56:08.000000', NULL, 1),
(6315948, 935069, 121082, '<td valign="top">Great job! Awesome photo.</td>', 'Great job! Awesome photo.', '2011-02-15 22:56:32.000000', NULL, 1),
(6315951, 935685, 121082, '<td valign="top">Awesome Photo. 1 of my favs. Solid 9.</td>', 'Awesome Photo. 1 of my favs. Solid 9.', '2011-02-15 22:58:44.000000', NULL, 1),
(6315952, 935139, 114225, '<td valign="top">Interesting use of two main subjects in different quadrants. I''m not so sure about the sky, seems like it has some strange colors going on.</td>', 'Interesting use of two main subjects in different quadrants. I''m not so sure about the sky, seems like it has some strange colors going on.', '2011-02-15 22:59:20.000000', NULL, 1),
(6315953, 935448, 114225, '<td valign="top">Nicely done. I''m sure some one like that this face is partially covered, but being a "sneaky" raccoon, hiding behind some brush seems appropriate and accentuates the photo nicely.</td>', 'Nicely done. I''m sure some one like that this face is partially covered, but being a "sneaky" raccoon, hiding behind some brush seems appropriate and accentuates the photo nicely.', '2011-02-15 23:00:22.000000', NULL, 1),
(6315955, 935607, 114225, '<td valign="top">I like what you were trying with this, with the complimentary colors. But the sharpening is overdone to the max. You can actually see individual pixels, which is almost never a good thing.</td>', 'I like what you were trying with this, with the complimentary colors. But the sharpening is overdone to the max. You can actually see individual pixels, which is almost never a good thing.', '2011-02-15 23:01:24.000000', NULL, 1),
(6315956, 935689, 114225, '<td valign="top">Hmm, so I''m torn on if this fits the challenge or not. One could argue the tips of the steeples are in the rule of thirds areas, so it works. But to me, this is a center composition, which is completely un-rule-of-thirds.</td>', 'Hmm, so I''m torn on if this fits the challenge or not. One could argue the tips of the steeples are in the rule of thirds areas, so it works. But to me, this is a center composition, which is completely un-rule-of-thirds.', '2011-02-15 23:02:32.000000', NULL, 1),
(6315957, 935336, 114225, '<td valign="top">Nice subject, and nice job fitting the challenge. But this photo feels very over sharpened to me. For instance, look at the antennae and notice how there is this vey distinct white edge around them that isn''t natural? That''s what really keying me into an over-sharpened effect.</td>', 'Nice subject, and nice job fitting the challenge. But this photo feels very over sharpened to me. For instance, look at the antennae and notice how there is this vey distinct white edge around them that isn''t natural? That''s what really keying me into an over-sharpened effect.', '2011-02-15 23:05:07.000000', NULL, 1),
(6315958, 934928, 114225, '<td valign="top">Wonderful scene and great use of depth of field. Going black and white with this subject is risky (in my mind) but you did it well with nice contrast.</td>', 'Wonderful scene and great use of depth of field. Going black and white with this subject is risky (in my mind) but you did it well with nice contrast.', '2011-02-15 23:06:14.000000', NULL, 1),
(6315960, 935035, 114225, '<td valign="top">Great details and depth of field. I''m sure this will be beautiful when it opens, but I find it very cool how you chose to photograph it before the typical shot would be taken.</td>', 'Great details and depth of field. I''m sure this will be beautiful when it opens, but I find it very cool how you chose to photograph it before the typical shot would be taken.', '2011-02-15 23:08:07.000000', NULL, 1),
(6315961, 934788, 121082, '<td valign="top">Super Photo. 1 of my favs. 9</td>', 'Super Photo. 1 of my favs. 9', '2011-02-15 23:08:26.000000', NULL, 1),
(6316515, 935333, 110447, '<td valign="top">beautiful</td>', 'beautiful', '2011-02-16 08:27:54.000000', NULL, 1),
(6316558, 935654, 113411, '<td valign="top">How wonderful!</td>', 'How wonderful!', '2011-02-16 09:02:27.000000', NULL, 1),
