(6320009, 935108, 17507, '<td valign="top">This is my favorite photo of the challenge. I like that it''s the weight of the tree that most strictly follows the rule of thirds, and the rest of the photo is unconstrained by an artificial need for literal compliance with a custom-cum-rule (even if it thus meets the challenge to a somewhat lesser degree). This is an artful work that is worthy of framing.</td>', 'This is my favorite photo of the challenge. I like that it''s the weight of the tree that most strictly follows the rule of thirds, and the rest of the photo is unconstrained by an artificial need for literal compliance with a custom-cum-rule (even if it thus meets the challenge to a somewhat lesser degree). This is an artful work that is worthy of framing.', '2011-02-18 15:50:32.000000', NULL, 1),
(6320180, 935659, 115307, '<td valign="top">I really like the idea, but there is a bit too much going on in this picture for me. Its very very busy. Meets the challenge. 6</td>', 'I really like the idea, but there is a bit too much going on in this picture for me. Its very very busy. Meets the challenge. 6', '2011-02-18 19:11:53.000000', NULL, 1),
