(6320186, 935432, 115307, '<td valign="top">This is an amazing photograph. It kind of looks like a bird house, which gives this photo a pretty cool perspective. I just love the editing of this. One of my highest votes.</td>', 'This is an amazing photograph. It kind of looks like a bird house, which gives this photo a pretty cool perspective. I just love the editing of this. One of my highest votes.', '2011-02-18 19:19:40.000000', NULL, 1),
